;: fmode.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written and hand-routed: a mode-F block
;: whose functions read E as their fourth input.  The routes are APR's for
;: t2.lca; APR itself would rewrite the block as mode FG.
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk AA
Base F
Config X: Y:F F:A:B:C:E DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:
Equate F = (A*B)+(C*~E)
Endblk
Editblk P11
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P10
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P9
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P8
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P7
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI:
Endblk
Addnet NA P11.I AA.A
NProgram NA PAD1.I:AA.A
Addnet NB P10.I AA.B
NProgram NB row.A.local.1:AA.B row.A.local.1:PAD2.I
Addnet NC P9.I AA.E
NProgram NC BC.20.1.0 BC.20.1.19 BB.20.1.5 BB.20.1.19 row.B.local.1:AA.E col.C.local.1:PAD5.I
Addnet ND P8.I AA.C
NProgram ND BD.20.1.4 BD.20.1.15 BB.20.1.8 BB.20.1.17 BC.20.1.9 BC.20.1.16 row.B.local.3:AA.C col.D.local.5:PAD6.I
Addnet NF AA.Y P7.O
NProgram NF AD.20.1.8 AD.20.1.15 AC.20.1.9 AC.20.1.16 row.A.local.4:AA.Y row.A.local.4:PAD7.O
